<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <script src="https://unpkg.com/twemoji@latest/dist/twemoji.min.js" crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
  <script>
    window.onload = function () {
      twemoji.parse(document.body);
    }
  </script>
</head>

<div>
  <%# Fuime: was HCB's logo fetched from assets.hackclub.com, above the heading
      "The Hack Foundation". On a pay stub that is both a live request to another
      company's CDN when the PDF renders (Prime Directive 4) and their letterhead
      on a document Fuime issues. Served locally, and the heading names the
      entity that actually pays. %>
  <%= image_tag "logo-512.png", height: "100px" %>
  <div>
    <h1 style="margin-block: 0">
      <%= Rails.configuration.constants.legal_entity_name %>
    </h1>
    <h4 style="margin-block: 0">
      8605 Santa Monica Blvd #86294
      <br />
      West Hollywood, CA, 90069
    </h4>
  </div>
  <div>
    <u>PAYMENT STATEMENT</u>
    <span style="text-transform: uppercase">FOR: <b><%= @payment.employee.user.name %></b></span>
    on
    <span>
      <b><%= @payment.payout.created_at.strftime("%Y-%m-%d") %></b>
    </span>
  </div>
</div>

<table>
  <tr>
    <th>Project</th>
    <th>Description</th>
    <th>Amount</th>
    <th>YTD earnings</th>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><%= @payment.employee.event.name %></td>
    <td><%= @payment.title %></td>
    <td>
      <%= render_money @payment.amount  %>
    </td>
    <td>
      <%= render_money @payment.employee.payments.paid.where(created_at: @payment.created_at.beginning_of_year.to_time..@payment.created_at).sum(:amount_cents)  %>
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>

<%# Fuime: removed "<org> is fiscally sponsored by The Hack Foundation, a
    501(c)(3) nonprofit with the EIN 81-2908499." On a PAY STUB this was the
    worst placement of the sentence — a document a recipient may hand to a
    landlord, a lender or the IRS, naming the wrong entity as the payer's
    sponsor and quoting an EIN that is not ours. BRAND_STRINGS.md category 3. %>

<style>
  body {
    padding: 16px;
    color: black;
  }
  h4 {
    font-weight: 400
  }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    margin-top: 36px;
    border-spacing: 0;
  }
  th {
    background: #ec3750;
    color: #fff;
    font-weight: 400;
    text-align: left;
    padding-left: 8px;
    padding-right: 8px;
  }
  tr:nth-child(odd) {
      background-color: #ececec;
  }
  td {
    border: none;
  }
  img.emoji {
    height: 1em;
    width: 1em;
    margin: 0 .05em 0 .1em;
    vertical-align: -0.1em;
  }
</style>
